      "date": "2026-05-21T12:49:10.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: Revenues exceed analysts expectations while EPS lags behind",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹16.68 (up from ₹12.34 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹30.9b (up 41% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹6.87b (up 35% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 22% (down from 23% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 2.0%. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 3.3%. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 39% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 16% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
